     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Custom Cape Cod Cannabis “420” Baseball Jersey"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Celebrate 4/20 the right way with our <strong>limited-edition Cape Cod Cannabis custom baseball jersey</strong> — fully stitched, professionally embroidered, and made to order with your name and number. Built for real Cape Cod Cannabis fans who want something better than basic merch. Quantities are limited, so lock yours in now, rep the culture, and rock a piece of 4/20 you’ll actually wear again and again.</p><p>Every stitch is carefully embroidered for a professional and eye-catching look.</p><p>Order your LIMITED EDITION Custom Cape Cod Cannabis “420” baseball jersey with embroidery today and experience the thrill of wearing a truly personalized piece of cannabis apparel.</p><p><strong>Each custom baseball jersey is meticulously personalized with the following features:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Material: 100% polyester</strong></li><li><strong>Jersey with stitched tackle twill name &amp; number</strong></li><li><strong>Moisture-wicking fabric has spongy handle, good draping property and elasticity as well as good dimensional stability and wrinkle-resistance</strong></li><li><strong>Breathable &amp; quick-drying</strong></li><li><strong>Athletic cut &amp; exquisite stitching not easy to fall off</strong></li><li><strong>Rounded droptail hem</strong></li><li><strong>Full-button front</strong></li><li><strong>Tagless collar offers clean comfort</strong></li><li><strong>Machine wash, do not tumble dry</strong></li></ul>"
    }
   ]
